(7734901, 1270543, 29535, '<td valign="top">Great exposure and subject!<br/> <br/>My main advice for this one is be careful with the plane of your shot angle - the subject looks good but then the fruit bowl makes us realise we''re kind of upside down, bending over and it''s a little unnatural. Play around with the angle a bit next time to find one that really works whilst getting everything in shot (it isn''t always easy at all, but then you can go with the ''flat lay'' setup if all else fails!)</td>', 'Great exposure and subject! My main advice for this one is be careful with the plane of your shot angle - the subject looks good but then the fruit bowl makes us realise we''re kind of upside down, bending over and it''s a little unnatural. Play around with the angle a bit next time to find one that really works whilst getting everything in shot (it isn''t always easy at all, but then you can go with the ''flat lay'' setup if all else fails!)', '2022-12-18 13:35:05.000000', NULL, 0);
